# Merged layer on dev

Tagger: MARBERTv2, dialect + foreign (src/tag_merged.py). Foreign model: m2m100 fine-tune, unchanged. Dialect: dictionary + gemma4:12b (rag, k=8, +gen3 examples). Tier thresholds min_n=2, min_c=0.8.

## Dialect sentences (dev, 290)

### variant: gemma

| step | value |
|---|---|
| dialect span detection P / R / F1 | 81.5 / 81.3 / 81.4 |
| spans that need a change, found | 82.2% of 555 |
| end-to-end exact | 36.2% |
| suggested tier: share of found / exact | 28.5% / 76.2% |
| review tier: exact | 31.3% |
| foreign spans wrongly found in dialect sentences | 2 |

### variant: m2m_first

| step | value |
|---|---|
| dialect span detection P / R / F1 | 81.5 / 81.3 / 81.4 |
| spans that need a change, found | 82.2% of 555 |
| end-to-end exact | 29.9% |
| suggested tier: share of found / exact | 28.5% / 76.2% |
| review tier: exact | 20.6% |
| foreign spans wrongly found in dialect sentences | 2 |

### The two sources on the found dialect spans that need a change

